#: scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b88c0fe7412a485c1e4cc2bb41ba13fd3443161dd3c28183aebb46979c3ecae8
#. default-sha256: 4a4800c8de7c0329580c314b75b55f4446c74ae989e8cf704ac756197cc52dff
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0AB00C9C_7603_4B7D_94F0_422B925F4353"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫It was the spring of my "
"fourteenth year."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫十四の、⟪k:13⟫春だった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d7e6d3e5f4035bc172618669782f3453ba36586d1bb46371aed5f0d4c20a04a
#. default-sha256: 4411fac3eb6c28bc047b38403ca7f1e222e11148ed827d91913eb92ed5c9fe07
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_96C5866C_6F64_4692_8371_78D096629E7A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, for one, preferred it when the sun ⟪k:1⟫wasn’t⟪k:2⟫ out.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Not that sunlight would "
"kill me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫私にとっては、⟪k:1⟫日差しなど無い方がありがたい。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あったからといって死ぬわけではない"
"が――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a5b30edd96e3252f17d26556d97443dac70ebee76b39d1d228b0f5f4f7d6b90
#. default-sha256: e7ca6e09954135b20a8a4bf8bb3e96f55c734cf6fbb3a409804937e81b3a4f61
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8FBE7F3A_6B09_46E2_9E5E_F71067DF0D22"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but if it was bright enough, the whole world was so white I could hardly see a thing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫強烈な光は、⟪k:1⟫前すら見えない程、⟪k:2⟫世界を白くさせてしまう。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6382838b41508a007a136b36b19262df1918fa775e1efaec8b13d2fbf56eedd9
#. default-sha256: 9b0b4f88f318f872016f79dfd87bb3b8c55d81aa833cbada2a72ae90e2b02645
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_33EABD98_BC03_4C5B_A81A_10244168B25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As I was meandering through the courtyard,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫中庭をあてもなく歩いていると――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_47DE9F2F_B236_42A3_8344_89543D58A343
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12d592fb00938ecb67e9507ffd8dadca8be56f0ecde1b794a0ab64744a168fa5
#. default-sha256: 992212d4ddef8fb60c10b80853f194aca2330231499e2f473fab7e1649517aea
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_47DE9F2F_B236_42A3_8344_89543D58A343"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I spotted someone I had never seen before."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫見知らぬ後姿を見つけた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7A0FC6F3_CC1D_4374_8C85_9A990957566C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1160021d7247052883e0b2cee1bbea8036255c59edd5a7801023caa59f39c04
#. default-sha256: 5053ce20d340e90d161c2526a9040b7d840055cb941dec8727965762864317c1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7A0FC6F3_CC1D_4374_8C85_9A990957566C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Who are you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………誰ですか。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_55F98633_ED37_45A9_8D4F_1F8F68725FB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f524f725b9527bd7ae78c78e750ac3d2136e4a4ba52dd397e54539298c5d23e5
#. default-sha256: a5f94e4b3d717d4a047c16c687fc86edaacf836e5eb3e0f0821f096aba1adc7e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_55F98633_ED37_45A9_8D4F_1F8F68725FB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I asked bluntly, and the girl twirled around, smiling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私のぶしつけな質問に対して、⟪k:1⟫振り返ったその人は微笑んだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5541FDCB_DB15_422E_B325_810ED59E7372
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe64a53ce6d417c20ddfa1983a191deff4e0e185cbdd57ac8c2fc3b62e0136b7
#. default-sha256: 2ddef96f34cdeddec537ebf50736aa353773733d35a202257616ce88abf025fb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5541FDCB_DB15_422E_B325_810ED59E7372"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫My apologies. You just have such a beautiful courtyard here I let myself in for a "
"little walk."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ごめんね、⟪k:2⟫綺麗な中庭だったから……勝手にうろうろしちゃった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_45288BEE_D663_41C1_AF44_3429D72D3EE7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b5d93a76eddc3686544ad83e7e70ab6b635d7c62b21b5c61c302e12a0c1ccba7
#. default-sha256: 51c82eeafafa742543f7de09ee82cbeecef165e99dd625515af8294455a01a58
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_45288BEE_D663_41C1_AF44_3429D72D3EE7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Long, chestnut hair flowed over round, feminine shoulders.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It swayed slightly in "
"the wind."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫長い栗色の髪が、⟪k:1⟫女らしく丸みのある肩をすべり、⟪k:2⟫風を受けている。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0B2ABE52_A65A_4EF3_A1D8_199842CE8E31
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2da9858edc17525835a62e7f32508044dfaedb95def868239e5c9f61e4f33b8c
#. default-sha256: 6b268ee3db62d7902feb0d57acce26d30c1dc52296b840f66abc687346a58435
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0B2ABE52_A65A_4EF3_A1D8_199842CE8E31"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cloud of melancholy dissipated in the light of her smile."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫曇天の鬱々とした空気を、⟪k:1⟫彼女の笑みが払いのける。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4D4E9084_E870_492E_A998_C5D99E26EDB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf0319a41c42d32af97bf99fb077cd5c56893d1dd1b57cbcd4b4fe1d00ca22ad
#. default-sha256: 3a1f2a7dce66fb888a8bea7a61be63b94e40439ed59aa39ed491d129e6cf7728
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4D4E9084_E870_492E_A998_C5D99E26EDB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You must be Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫You’re just as pretty as I heard."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫あなた、⟪k:2⟫ミシェルね？⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫お話に聞いていた通りだわ。⟪k:5⟫本当に綺麗な女の子なの"
"ねえ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CCB94BB0_F5ED_434C_B5C7_F0C5C7FCCBAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf7ea826e194c271f71b1a75f8c3e4101a3843f879fcbc8ca2416524a8075c27
#. default-sha256: e3f9c92a00da7853ef80eb470422b83e75232f9f8f2812c8f72189d33f964201
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CCB94BB0_F5ED_434C_B5C7_F0C5C7FCCBAA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Finally” meet me? What was she talking about?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As I stood there, baffled by this "
"strange woman,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫何をどうよろしくすればいいのか、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫訳もわからず突っ立ったままの私に――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0C0861C5_D4B4_453C_8326_7C12D391459E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbecfb0d36ffe7431c1a8b5328fd0ef24f56b942696acd2249e5d9280c2c7a27
#. default-sha256: d8b6bc0b136f0220b166803d1ae514b13047e6f1ee4005d5188fe0d315c2f872
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0C0861C5_D4B4_453C_8326_7C12D391459E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’m thrilled to make your acquaintance, Michelle."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫お近づきになれてとてもうれしいわ、⟪k:2⟫ミシェル。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_395D00B7_3D6A_4726_82D2_4B0208B5AAE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98ca02fcc2a9ffdf09299dd1cd269f537966fcd602fcc8911046930e22c49b47
#. default-sha256: 25dfaf40654b2e949137fb7d87475fb253268029141a5d53cd3f5cbdcca14787
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_395D00B7_3D6A_4726_82D2_4B0208B5AAE9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her voice was like someone pouring honey into my ear."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女の囁きはとろけるほど甘く――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2E190DA1_1B5B_42B8_9724_46FD4AEA5E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d2c5757a44dd3a740d982ff80acabbdce47b8346b22e8c567c10d36438cf08b7
#. default-sha256: 2b05881ef015f14a2efb90c7906828e0a07c9b58393adea97c26152a4fdd2d1a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2E190DA1_1B5B_42B8_9724_46FD4AEA5E64"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫stuck another needle into my chest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私を突き刺す胸の痛みを、⟪k:1⟫更に大きなものにした。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_92BD0387_003C_458B_BBFA_677D0840B7BC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cd510100cf3745cd9f2b451c76322e0b0b961a2016a86cedd3823bb13825979e
#. default-sha256: 8c4e3d6a8a7968d080d710a7132bfebfb0c60e6e1f213ac9dafed360ee08b629
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_92BD0387_003C_458B_BBFA_677D0840B7BC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one had told me my brother was to be married."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私は次兄の交流関係について、⟪k:1⟫まったく知らされていなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EA1FB27_A290_45D4_B001_ED2BAE059597
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22750e50d5dded03dc3b8dd3b3f8be09a8f4f921cefd885b807db6b07e14f993
#. default-sha256: b1d01abdce493bea1cbba3ca9846bbec065ce949746f4e46fc257dc634cfb7e4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EA1FB27_A290_45D4_B001_ED2BAE059597"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My father Antonin looked so proud of his two boys—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Didier soon to receive his "
"assignment, and Georges soon to be wed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫配属を間近に控えた長兄ディディエと、⟪k:1⟫結婚を目前にした次兄ジョルジュを父は誇らしく思ってい"
"るようだった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_28390D52_0EA1_4574_8E8E_15A463F1A092
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc49a4374619674b65446fcbf4ccb11170b147a7c9d4c1f7df820b2b70581232
#. default-sha256: 30966df76c5a4973934986f5b2988f9cf3a5b332c934b7ce367e69cdbdee6b6b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_28390D52_0EA1_4574_8E8E_15A463F1A092"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The banquet proceeded smoothly,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫晩餐は始終和やかに進み――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_40ADECC1_364A_41F8_AF37_4F3E4BECF6B9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 004f98194cfb54cdb46ee4e67f56c21d07a38ef95315c9374685e3d21a3fe727
#. default-sha256: 107ff64f5940127f855d6ae8b7c7acfe98c9fe1707c487ba03f25f1fea033353
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_40ADECC1_364A_41F8_AF37_4F3E4BECF6B9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫not a doubt in the air that we were a happy family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫誰もがこの家の幸福を疑っていなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_12A5BB5F_4099_4D82_9B68_037211FB700C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5c488c7476c052502c95d4fb11bd5338f0f63d22e653aa1b7b7ddd75229b0dd
#. default-sha256: fe585d41b1ffd5d314ef6b4f39d16de5fae1b3548abddac3cd25e3025f2cdb67
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_12A5BB5F_4099_4D82_9B68_037211FB700C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But my mind was elsewhere."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私だけが、⟪k:1⟫違った。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_42746B8F_4494_49DF_A79B_BBA692F85693
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 49e4a460280438458f1b4991486beeca6ec85f01b284b71f83303fbc7da0b5a5
#. default-sha256: 30c6b8462add2cd4ec90f460c40fdf35ec306d528abf3ba56052fc8b584c1a2c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_42746B8F_4494_49DF_A79B_BBA692F85693"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I found myself unconsciously chasing Aimee with my eyes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫気付けばエメの仕草を目で追っていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_82923E7B_2641_4CE0_85D9_3B478E646923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a10be177dcc9fc478003ea7065edec78f3c7436e04ed4d5f663cf8db6c4a2f2
#. default-sha256: 385a3afcf43629e88a88d4f9a818ea14c7a70b420b2a91e63510697099d7f33f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_82923E7B_2641_4CE0_85D9_3B478E646923"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Watching the way those slender fingers gripped her spoon.⟪k:1⟫Her full lips parting to allow "
"a piece of fruit in."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫銀のスプーンを持つ繊細な指先や、⟪k:1⟫果実を含む厚めの唇。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_991665B7_761E_4CBB_9097_F7C40F47BB38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91a982c06c193b81a79369dc3262d237de6acbb3bb314103fdcd67b77d180e37
#. default-sha256: 45de6e995d14f8b81f19cc178d5cb7a9a682829fd9b75855f90970d26dca5e07
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_991665B7_761E_4CBB_9097_F7C40F47BB38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her deep red tongue, visible for but the briefest of moments."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫口を開いた時にのぞく、⟪k:1⟫赤みの強い舌。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3AAE7B4F_BF85_459B_B8D0_40E238F55F91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 761668cd7597940d39b44b41a5b3421d03912c5cc55fe0797247dc11692618bf
#. default-sha256: 0bbb5c5a107ba9abc5e1be2878c7979543eeb778f20eea03046aef1b0eb603ee
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3AAE7B4F_BF85_459B_B8D0_40E238F55F91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The way all the muscles in her face seemed to relax in bliss as sweet juices seeped into her "
"mouth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫おだやかに目じりを下げる彼女の目元。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_936CDD6B_9C02_4118_9168_A93944FB0CB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccd4940aabb8143cf4e6f26a457057518aab8e58a85ae325430b3b0d45fa0c4d
#. default-sha256: 2440f2fd3543cb946485f4a34269bd5c223bc24eabda40570d14b65d396b3446
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_936CDD6B_9C02_4118_9168_A93944FB0CB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The way she spoke, so soft and gentle, letting each sound hang in the air just briefly "
"before intoning the next."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫誰よりもゆっくりと喋る耳に心地よい声。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0D190A50_753D_446D_888B_297A70987ADE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b583269fcfcb4caebb349105905ba9fa65896d6c325e277edb8bfdcc3c567b8
#. default-sha256: acdc8dc275cfe325abff361f16dcdb1a837f4f865f5cbc7f3fae6c3e751165f7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0D190A50_753D_446D_888B_297A70987ADE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was distinctly feminine—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫in a different way than my mother."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫母とは違う女の香り――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D0282D63_AB66_4BCD_B5CC_D26348888576
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 94e00ab64bea52ae44750b1385311bb9c1230772a58c6e943ff7eeb4e56c09ac
#. default-sha256: 4ec85e2b153bb721d938af51050b65fad154209e35c28ff79801042336b0a75f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D0282D63_AB66_4BCD_B5CC_D26348888576"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Apparently, Aimee was going to be living at the Bollinger estate for some time."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……エメは暫く、⟪k:1⟫ボランジェ家に滞在するらしい。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_81C2E136_5BC7_4B56_8605_CACB3CA4CCA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed207566d2b03ebfb20ba54dec55540ffcce0755fc4747952fd707a65c060299
#. default-sha256: fce27e4704daa0a813465aaec05efe20aba67e04b9fb9134934c71a18b8a9250
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_81C2E136_5BC7_4B56_8605_CACB3CA4CCA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had assumed I would hate being around another girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫女の相手をするのはまっぴらだと思っていた。"

