msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was to present my hand to the man—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫for him to kiss."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫手の甲を差し出し――口付けを受ける。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2327DAAB_30A8_4D32_B4F8_3E0DC5D41020
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06dfbda6b4222cb35d5b2be3afd2ff23f81d7789fcd6d0bd72f7c9ed9d93c593
