msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Why? Why was ⟪k:1⟫this⟪k:2⟫ a traditional greeting?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Why did I have to go through "
"this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫なぜ？⟪k:1⟫　なぜこんな挨拶がある？⟪k:2⟫　なぜ私がそうしなければならない？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7172897A_D912_4EF8_80D5_B5C5A76497D8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17ea7b0adc05d7d24a9f6c9b212f601d43ff60dbabbf064707f489a974708c08
