msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The man kneeling before me gave an uncomfortable chuckle at my reluctance, shrugged, and "
"reverently took my hand in his."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――目の前の男は、⟪k:1⟫私の態度に苦笑をしたが、⟪k:2⟫おどけたように肩を竦め私の手を恭しく取っ"
"た。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EA0A6502_E193_4DF5_B658_A0DFF2517305
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8a55830001f282fd70a7919833138d4f040d20c8ca0166e8094405a6c5c55b2
