msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You’ve got a tongue like a boy, milady.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫But I know some people’re fond o’ that "
"these days.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Can’t say I mind, m’self."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫男っぽい言葉づかいなんだなあ。⟪k:1⟫でも、⟪k:2⟫そういうのも昨今悪くないと思うね。⟪k:3⟫俺は結構"
"好きだなあ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E87CAB54_D147_4DD3_B847_9EE7FF0445A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7c805e430f80b0a85c1f23719c6aa9ebe8252a8b5433c691f9da41e2d84d26d9
#. default-sha256: 5f9ef52aa9dd46ecc0711a1a6cea53b1bed932fddc6de248fa3666c31e9f692d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E87CAB54_D147_4DD3_B847_9EE7FF0445A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why did I have to get stuck with this body?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……なんで……、⟪k:1⟫私の身体は――、⟪k:2⟫こうなんだ……？"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BB334368_EA29_49F2_BBE4_C5C688AFB3B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c248fee39fa8f6f98ee11eecdac31130bb897317aba1db63d8981964e6cdb233
