msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BB334368_EA29_49F2_BBE4_C5C688AFB3B0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, just so we’re clear, I’m not going to hurt you.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’m no monster—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I "
"promise you that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫勘違いしないで欲しいね、⟪k:1⟫別に君を襲っちまおうとか、⟪k:2⟫そんなひどいこと考えちゃいないん"
"だよ。⟪k:3⟫本当にさ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_29DFBE46_F500_4AC9_810B_EB3F12314404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fa30d41a6e6fff8400b72fd838b3f69fc8f7eae028ee1150306bc9f02c91e95
