msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_272A67D3_F4A5_4706_89C4_A55D0E0C478E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But if I do that, you’ll run away.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫And it’s my personal rule to never let go of "
"anything I like."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そうしたら、⟪k:1⟫君は逃げちゃうだろう？⟪k:2⟫　俺はね、⟪k:3⟫好きなものはこの手に捕まえておきた"
"い主義なんだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_1B719745_4C01_42EC_881F_865A27C78D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 589659eaa29b0a6fe896bc67399fedb386ba72ae85e61e21967d22226e2168a3
